---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Meet — Greg O'Brien" description="Get in touch with Greg O'Brien, product manager and maker based in Dublin." current={4}>
<div data-screen-label="Meet">
<div data-hero="1" style="border-top:1px solid var(--edge);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:38px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
<div data-hero-left="1" style="padding:96px 56px 84px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Meet</div>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:54px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em">Let's <span style="font-style:italic">talk</span>.</h1>
<div style="margin-top:34px;width:100%;height:280px;border:1px solid var(--rule);overflow:hidden"><img src="/images/portrait.jpg" alt="Greg O'Brien" width="1800" height="989" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" /></div>
</div>
<div data-hero-right="1" style="padding:calc(96px + 32.5px + 59.4px + 34px) 56px 84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--body);max-width:46ch">I like meeting other makers and thinkers, and talking about the things we're building. If that sounds like your world too, if you need someone for a stage, or think I'd be useful for a project you're working on, please reach out.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)"><span>Based in Dublin</span><span>·</span><a href="#" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none" class="h-ul">Email</a><a href="#" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none" class="h-ul">LinkedIn</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding:40px 56px 34px">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Talk to me about</span>
<div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:78ch">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">01</span><span>Agentic AI product strategy</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">02</span><span>Safety and governance in AI products</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">03</span><span>Making the jump into AI product management</span></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">04</span><span>Building things on the side, badly and joyfully</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:40px 56px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Say hello</span>
<a href="/" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">Home →</a>
</div>
<div data-split="1" style="padding:14px 0 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start">
<div style="padding:0 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr;gap:18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--body)"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Currently</span><span>Director of Product Management, enterprise AI agents at Mastercard.</span></div>
<div style="padding:0 56px"><div style="border:1px solid var(--edge);padding:26px;background:var(--surface)">
<div style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:24px">Get in touch</div>
<div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px"><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);transition:opacity .2s ease" class="h-dim">Email</a><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid var(--edge);color:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease" class="h-card">LinkedIn</a></div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
